# design-lint exceptions for RTI. Each line is a deliberate, argued exception,
# not debt: debt lives in .design-lint-baseline.json and must only fall.
# Form: <glob>            whole file exempt
#       <glob>:<regex>    exempt only lines matching the regex

# DESIGN.md, "One allowed categorical palette": the six speaker colours are
# data, so Speaker 1, 2, 3 stay distinct. They stay local to RTI. The rest of
# RTIDesign.swift is linted normally.
RTI/Sources/UI/RTIDesign.swift:SwiftUI\.Color\(red:.*// (blue|red|green|purple|amber|teal)
# The same six colours need a lighter tint in the dark appearance, because the
# live transcript draws each speaker's name in its colour (DESIGN.md "Live
# transcript"). Each pair is one palette entry, built by one helper.
RTI/Sources/UI/RTIDesign.swift:speaker\(light:.*// (blue|red|green|purple|amber|teal)
RTI/Sources/UI/RTIDesign.swift:NSColor\(srgbRed: rgb\.0
